Package: sas2r
Title: Translate SAS Programs to R with Dependency-Aware Migration
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Songyue", "Chen", email = "chuckknow@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Translates SAS programs and projects to R using dependency-aware
    orchestration, program smoke execution, and final-output evidence.
    Deterministic and offline by default; optional agent review and repair
    send bounded excerpts to a configured 'ellmer' provider only when one is
    supplied.
